There are four possible structural isomers of $\text{C}_8\text{H}_{10}$ that contain a benzene ring.

Draw the **skeletal** formulae of the four structural isomers in the appropriate boxes. The number of peaks observed in the carbon-13 ($^{13}\text{C}$) NMR spectrum of each compound is given.

